{"unit_id":"Stijnus__dsh-workspace-status#card-zh","repo":"Stijnus/dsh-workspace-status","commit":"c3ca1a0fc99a4b315c7911703f0ba970038ea312","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-workspace-status 是面向 DSH Web 侧边栏的界面插件：它聚合工作区内会话状态，在文件夹行显示等待、运行或刚完成标记，并把置顶会话按工作区集中展示。置顶区支持折叠、取消置顶和通知；适合需要快速查看多个工作区进展的用户。通知权限由浏览器按需请求，不依赖模型工具或额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:421","client.js:650","client.js:1439"]}
{"unit_id":"Stijnus__dsh-workspace-status#card-en","repo":"Stijnus/dsh-workspace-status","commit":"c3ca1a0fc99a4b315c7911703f0ba970038ea312","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-workspace-status adds activity marks and a pinned-conversation area to the DSH sidebar. It groups pins by workspace, shows waiting, running, or recently finished states, and provides in-app plus optional desktop notifications. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:421","client.js:650","client.js:1439"]}
