{"unit_id":"Stijnus__dsh-workspace-status#feature-workspace-marks","repo":"Stijnus/dsh-workspace-status","commit":"c3ca1a0fc99a4b315c7911703f0ba970038ea312","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-workspace-status 的功能「工作区状态标记」：按会话状态汇总每个工作区的等待、运行和近期完成情况，并在侧边栏文件夹行尾显示优先级最高的标记；归档会话不计入，完成标记一小时后过期。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:421","client.js:547"]}
{"unit_id":"Stijnus__dsh-workspace-status#feature-pinned-list","repo":"Stijnus/dsh-workspace-status","commit":"c3ca1a0fc99a4b315c7911703f0ba970038ea312","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-workspace-status 的功能「置顶会话区」：把原生置顶会话从常规列表提取到工作区列表上方，按工作区分组显示状态与相对时间；可以折叠分组、打开会话或取消置顶，折叠偏好保存在浏览器本地。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:650","client.js:1005","client.js:1324"]}
{"unit_id":"Stijnus__dsh-workspace-status#feature-notifications","repo":"Stijnus/dsh-workspace-status","commit":"c3ca1a0fc99a4b315c7911703f0ba970038ea312","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-workspace-status 的功能「置顶会话通知」：置顶会话开始等待处理或运行结束未读时显示应用内提醒；窗口在后台且已获系统授权时也发桌面通知。铃铛控制通知，喇叭切换提示音，偏好保存在浏览器本地。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:850","client.js:875","client.js:1148"]}
